### ====== TASKO API TESTS (OAuth) ======
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083

### 0) Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health


### 1) Current user (OAuth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me


### 2) My projects — initially []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/my


### 3) Create project — save joinCode + projectId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo Project",
  "description": "for tasks tests",
  "deadline": "2026-02-01"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("projectId", response.body.id);
    client.global.set("joinCode", response.body.joinCode);
%}


### 4) My projects after create
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/my


### 5) Enrolled projects before join — []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/enrolled


### 6) Join by code (same user = ok, no duplicate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "joinCode": "{{joinCode}}"
}


### 7) Enrolled projects after join
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/enrolled


### 8) Join with wrong code — 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "joinCode": "WRONG123"
}


### ===== TASKS =====

### 9) List tasks — []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks


### 10) Create task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task 1",
  "description": "First task",
  "deadline": "2026-02-10",
  "maxScore": 100
}

> {%
    client.global.set("taskId", response.body.id);
%}


### 11) Create task without title — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "description": "no title"
}


### 12) List tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks


### 13) Get task by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}


### 14) Update task
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task 1 updated",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "deadline": "2026-02-15",
  "maxScore": 80
}


### 15) Update only maxScore
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxScore": 60
}


### 16) Update status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### 17) Delete task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}


### 18) Get deleted task — 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}


### 19) List tasks after delete — []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
